            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1006-f2" n="17" xml:id="d1006-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 10342, October 4, 8 p.m., from London, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1006-f3" n="18" xml:id="d1006-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 10237, October 2, 3 p.m., from London, which stated that the notes had
                    been agreed upon; the texts were transmitted in telegram 10246, October 2, <ref
                        target="#pg1321">p. 1321</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
